WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.190
All right, all right...

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.440
This isn't working at all.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.940
They're going to fly away.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.530
It's sparkling.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.410
How pretty...

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.250
That
Selection
is...

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:38.510
shinjitsu wa hitoe ni kaado no uraomote
Truth and reality are like the two sides of a card

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:44.020
tokenai mama
Forever entwined

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:48.840
mekurimekuru meku
Thrust upon this chaotic stage

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.780
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.030
memagurushii suteeji de
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way
I spin around and lose my way

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:02.080
sono karamatta kanjou wo manzoku iku made nankai mo
Until I can finally sort out these mixed-up emotions

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.330
kowashite shimae
I'll destroy it countless times

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:10.420
unmei ni temaneki sare samayou ashita wa
The uncertain future will be summoned by fate

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.720
nani wo erande nani wo tebanashi hitotsu ni nareba iin darou
Should I choose just one thing to let go of?

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:21.470
najitta tefuda wo sarasu yoyuu nante nai yo
I can't afford to let my sinful hand show yet

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:26.560
kawaita koukai no umi wo nomihosu hibi wa
My days of leisurely drinking from the sea of regret are long over

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:31.900
kagirareta kotoba de itsushika no egao yurushite hoshiin darou
Will you really use your one wish to return that lost smile?

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:38.110
utsutsu wo wasuretatte kamawanai yo dakara
It's no concern of mine if you avert your eyes from reality

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.870
ima wa shiranai de itai nee
So please just live in blissful ignorance

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.300
Hitoe...

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.800
That scrunchie!

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.140
Hitoe...

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.730
To be honest, I remembered it...

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:09.100
The time I spent with you two.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.190
<i>Hitoe!</i>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.530
<i>Hitoe?</i>

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.650
<i>Hitoe?!</i>

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:19.950
It hurt.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:24.330
My chest felt like it was being torn apart.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.210
Still, I thought to myself...

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.540
<i>I... want to remember.</i>

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.420
<i>Hitoe?!</i>

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:37.970
Even if it meant pain and
suffering for me, I still wanted...

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.680
<i>...to remember!</i>

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:41.090
Hitoe!

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:46.060
B-But why did you hide that from us until n—

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.980
I wanted my wish to come true!

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.310
I wanted friends...

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.520
No, it didn't matter what my wish was.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:59.110
Because as long as I win,
Yuzuki will become an Eternal Girl

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.740
and be released from the card.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.450
Isn't that right?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.540
What are you saying, Hitoe?!

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.790
That doesn't solve anything at all!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.250
I'd just be stealing your—

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:19.050
My friends really care for me.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:23.220
Just that is enough to be a dream come true.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.180
That someone would sacrifice herself for me...

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:33.310
I didn't know something as beautiful as that ever existed in this world.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.320
Rather than the existence of Selectors,

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.030
to me,

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.740
having met the two of you

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.110
is far...

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:44.660
<i>far</i> more

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.700
of a miracle.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.630
Being able to do something for a friend...

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.710
There's no greater happiness than this.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.510
This is the only wish I want to see granted.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.090
Hitoe!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.770
Friend...

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.860
Please, Tama...

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.070
Please accept my wish.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:20.610
Ruu?

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.570
I want to release her from the card.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.280
My friend...

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.830
My precious friend!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.710
Can I...

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.590
become your friend, too?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.680
Ruu!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.800
Tell me what to do!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.390
Tama needs to battle!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.190
To make your wish come true...

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.070
I need to battle!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.070
Thank you.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.780
Yuzuki!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.530
Hitoe!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.780
Let's continue the battle.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:11.080
And... I'm sorry, Hitoe!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.790
<i>I'm</i> going to win this battle!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.790
<i>I'm</i> going to have my wish come true!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.130
Ruuko?

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.920
Arch Aura!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.270
Hitoe...

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.190
Ruuko...

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.820
Did that hurt, Yuzuki?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.740
I'm all right.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.830
Anyway—Ruuko, about that earlier!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.580
Right! Ruuko, your wish...

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:01.250
I want Yuzuki and all the other girls who
were sealed inside the cards to be released.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:02.800
Ruuko...

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.010
H-Hold on!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:07.260
I told you we still need to think this through.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:11.220
Hitoe, Yuzuki, I feel the same way you do.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.770
Being able to do something for a friend...

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.100
is something to be really happy about!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.150
I'll be going now.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:30.240
Wait! I'll go with you!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.660
I'll go, too!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.990
Hitoe... Yuzuki...

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:35.910
But...

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.880
I give up. No use trying to talk you out of it.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.000
If your wish really does come true,

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.670
I should go back to normal

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.920
and you shouldn't be turned into a LRIG.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:52.390
Let's go buy some pork buns at the
convenience store when we go home.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.640
Yeah!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:12.370
Tama, let's do some shopping
when we go for pork buns later.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.450
Shopping?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.870
I'm going to buy you a matching scrunchie.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.370
Ruu!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.180
It's really scary being this high up...

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.270
The place where Grandma and I live
should be somewhere around there...

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.570
<i>Grandma...</i>

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.540
I've been waiting for you,

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:58.990
Ruu.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.500
"Ruu"?

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.370
You two came as well?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.000
Got a problem with that?

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.040
Not like we're gonna stop you or anything!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.420
It's all right.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.090
An audience doesn't make any difference.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.140
Is there anything you need?

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.510
Like a declaration of intent?

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.260
Or details of the situation here?

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.390
I don't need anything.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.110
I only want to battle.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.940
You're the best.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.110
Open!
Open!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.250
What a lonesome place...

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:52.880
Is this how it looks inside your heart?

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.930
You said battling is all you want?

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.470
Let's begin.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.160
You're first, Ruu.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:18.910
Grow!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:24.620
Grow!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.130
They're both so strong.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.720
But Ruuko's eyes...

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.470
They're kind of cold.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.890
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:48.270
<i>This battle doesn't feel fun or exciting like the battles I had before.</i>

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.400
<i>It's so quiet...</i>

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.490
<i>I can even hear Tama drawing breath.</i>

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.620
<i>With this battle...</i>

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.380
<i>I will...</i>

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.340
Grow!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.800
Sword Ability!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:29.520
Ulith.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.650
She's in a league of her own!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:40.870
You've already amassed enough wins to give birth to an Eternal Girl,

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.700
but the time wasn't quite ripe.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.740
Now it's finally time.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.250
No, not yet.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.160
Grow.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.500
No, still not quite yet...

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.260
This isn't all Ruuko has.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.630
My Kominato Ruuko!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.720
Black Desire!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.060
Tama...

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:11.850
Tama...

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.400
Tama!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.080
Tama... Tama...

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.830
<i>It's not Ruu.</i>

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:33.790
Tama...

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.340
<i>This isn't Ruu's voice.</i>

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:44.390
<i>But I know this voice even better than Ruu's.</i>

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.310
We finally meet, Tama.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.560
Wh-Who are you?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.200
You poor thing...

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:07.830
Look at all these bruises.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.790
Ruu is cruel, isn't she?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.290
You even wished for it.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.800
You wished to stay together forever.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.260
You wished with all your heart.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:31.180
Ruu must treasure her friends more than you.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.020
No!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.060
Ruu's not like that!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:38.190
She said I was her friend!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.190
Tama...

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.320
We're going to eat soft-serve ice cream together!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:46.280
She said she'd buy me matching scrunchies!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:46.620
And—

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.580
You poor, poor thing...

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:53.080
Ruu is doing this all for her friends.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.290
Not for you, Tama, but for her precious friends.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.000
She'd even become a LRIG for their sake.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:12:59.880
No!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.840
Ruu said we'd all go home together!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.260
That's why I have to—

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.630
That's wrong.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.760
It's all wrong, Tama.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.600
Remember!

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.860
It's easy.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:28.620
You don't want to fulfill Ruu's wish, right?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.830
Then it's easy.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.910
Just don't agree when the time comes.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.170
Yuzuki said it herself.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:41.380
A Selector's wish is only granted when her LRIG agrees to it.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.010
B-But then, Ruu will...!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.430
Try and win, then.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:53.890
Win the battle, and you will know Ruu's true feelings.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.600
Ruu's...

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.560
That is, if you <i>can</i> win the battle.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.730
Tama...

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:01.570
Tama!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:04.650
Tama, are you okay?

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.490
"Win... and you'll know."

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.160
Tama, don't overdo it.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.950
Ruu... I will fight.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.620
This is our last battle.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.330
Tama...

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.790
Now that's a good girl.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.630
The battle isn't over yet, right?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.550
Draw!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.470
Enercharge! Tama, level 4!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.100
<i>No matter what waits beyond my wish...</i>

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.850
<i>...this will be the last battle.</i>

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.100
<i>No matter what waits beyond this wish...</i>

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.850
<i>...this will be the last battle.</i>

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.520
<i>The last!
The last!</i>

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.150
Look!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.860
The white and black keep on colliding.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.410
The battlefield is...!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.140
The roof?

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:15.010
Were we... brought back from the battlefield?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.020
No, look at the sky.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.190
Tama and the others aren't done yet, either.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.530
Ruu! What should I do next?

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.740
Hurry!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.370
It's so pretty...

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.210
I wasn't really sure earlier,

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.550
but the place where Grandma and I live is right there.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.010
R-Ruu...

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.510
Thank you.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:55.760
You wanted to show me this before our final moment.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.510
"Final moment"...?

00:15:58.310 --> 00:15:59.470
Grandma...

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.730
Goodbye.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:11.070
See this, Iona? She thinks she already won.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:11.950
She's...

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.620
truly the best.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.910
Ruu...

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.500
What am I supposed to do now?

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:27.500
Swear an oath before the final attack.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.010
I understand.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:36.010
Right, Hanayo-san and I took an oath, too.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:40.020
It's the ultimate contract with the LRIG.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:43.390
But didn't Tama lose her memory?

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.910
What do I say now, Tama?

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:00.790
<i>It's true...</i>

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:06.170
<i>She doesn't think she can return now.</i>

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:13.260
For the sake of her friends,
Ruu is even ready to become a LRIG.

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:19.220
Ruu thinks she needs to become a LRIG to save everyone.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:21.770
Tama?

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.020
So, what do I say?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.230
I... accept...

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.860
I accept.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:34.530
the Laws of the Selector.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.860
The Laws of the Selector.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.800
Tama, thank you.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:58.340
Aww, they don't have any moves left and they're still taking <i>this</i> long.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.550
I'm bored to hell!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:04.520
Come on, let them have a nice one!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.730
Bloody Slash!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:11.650
Tama.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:12.900
Okay.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.400
White Hope!
White Hope!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.830
Wh-What? What is this?

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.790
Hey, what's going on here?!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:35.010
It's... finally happening...

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.520
What's the matter, Yuzuki?

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.230
Yuzuki?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.780
Yuzuki...

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:01.030
<i>I don't have any regrets.</i>

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:07.290
<i>Because no matter what happens, this is the wish I chose.</i>

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.620
<i>I chose it...</i>

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.640
No...

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.850
Ruuko won, so why...?!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.100
The oath wasn't complete.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.770
The last part of the oath—

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:36.480
"And now, a new Eternal Girl will be born."

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.110
Tama?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:44.410
I can't turn you into a LRIG after all...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.660
I can't say bye-bye to you...

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.000
I just don't want this!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:50.910
Tama...

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.500
Wh-What?!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:19:59.260
It's disappearing!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.260
Tama! The oath!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.180
Hurry, we need to say it again!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.890
No... Wait!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.270
It can't be!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.030
Why is Iona-san...

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:28.540
Iona was ready to have her wish granted all this time.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:32.750
She's already won more than enough Selector battles.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:38.630
But you know, she lacked a certain
condition to have her wish come true.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.500
A condition?

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:43.260
Right. That's why her wish was on hold.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:46.090
I guess the condition's met now.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.300
Yes...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.350
My wish will come true now.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.140
H-Hold on...

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.320
Tama!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.610
Please, hurry!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.700
Hurry and make my wish come true!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.030
Tama!

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.910
I accept
I accept

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.750
the Laws of the Selector.
the Laws of the Selector.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.660
No...

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.630
Don't... You can't!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.340
I need to bring them all back!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.630
And now, a new Eternal Girl
And now, a new Eternal Girl

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.180
will be born!
will be born!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.890
Don't!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:56.040
I-Iona-san...?

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:04.880
U-Ulith...

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:09.300
Let's meet again, scum.

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:15.770
Ruuko...

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:17.730
Tama! Why—

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:22.480
Tama...

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.860
Isn't this the very best,

00:22:29.860 --> 00:22:30.570
Ruu?

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.420
This tastes <i>great</i>!

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:42.630
Your white sauce is just too awesome, Grandma!

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:48.260
Ruu-chan is pretty late, isn't she...

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:50.010
You should just eat already.

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:52.260
No...

00:22:52.260 --> 00:22:53.760
You know,

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:57.060
I want to be with Ruu-chan.

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:00.560
<i>You know,</i>

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:03.730
<i>I want to be with you.</i>

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:05.780
Tama...

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:07.650
Where are you, Tama?!

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.240
Tama!

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:14.200
That was...

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:15.830
my wish.

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:24.420
It's been a while, scum.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:27.840
So, who wants to battle us first?

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:29.420
Is it because Tama was a bad girl?

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:31.930
You're my precious friend!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:38.640
selector spread WIXOSS
